      "component_id": "c_027",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "- Porters: 10-20 per bag carried. - Housekeeping: 10-20 pesos per day. - Concierge: A tip of 50-100 pesos is a fair tip to a concierge who has served you well.",
