    {
      "component_id": "c_033",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Tipping (la propina) is part and parcel of life in the Mexican service industry. Wages of hospitality staff in Mexico is generally very low and many of them supplement their daily wages with tips. you will encounter situations where you have to tip all the time, for example like when a carpark warden helps you guide your car into a car park, or when an attendant in the bathroom helps you with a towel to dry your hands. Remember to keep small change available for these 10 peso tips because small change isn't always easy to find in Mexico.",
      "content_desc": "",
      "resource_id": "",
      "clickable": false,
